RUN-TIME PARAMETERS — fill in before running:
TARGET CSR SECTION: [section number and title, e.g. 9.2 Inclusion Criteria]
HOUSE STYLE — TENSE & VOICE: [FILL IN FROM YOUR STYLE GUIDE]
e.g. "Past tense throughout; passive voice; report criteria as applied,
not as planned." Until this is filled in, the prompt will halt (see
FAILURE HANDLING). Do not leave this to model judgement.
HOUSE STYLE — CRITERION FORMATTING: [FILL IN]
e.g. "Numbered list, retaining protocol criterion numbering" or
